  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted ( 01_SWP_001PA Rev. A; 01_SWP_002PA Rev. A; 01_SWP_003PA Rev. B; 01_SWP_004PA Rev. A.\r\nReceived on 12 June 2019) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The premises shall be used for B2 use and for no other purpose (including any other purpose in Class B of the Schedule to the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987, or in any provision equivalent to that Class in any statutory instrument revoking and re-enacting that Order with or without modification).",
    "Condition : 4 - Prior to first use of the site under Use Class B2, revised details of the car parking spaces shall be submitted to the Council for approval. The submitted details must demonstrate the following:\r\n(a)\tThat a minimum of four (4) spaces suitable for disabled users would be provided in an appropriate location;\r\n(b)\tThat a minimum of six (6) spaces would be provided with an active electric vehicle charging station; \r\n(c)\tThat a minimum of six (6) spaces would be provided with a passive electric vehicle charging facility.\r\nand the details as approved shall have been installed in accordance with the approved details and thereafter retained as such\r\n",
    "Condition : 5 - Prior to first use of the site under Use Class B2, details of bicycle parking, showing a minimum of twenty (20)  secure, accessible and weatherproof spaces, shall have been submitted for approval and thereafter provided and retained in accordance with the approved details prior to first occupation under Use Class B2"
  ],
